 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Aapke customers ki phone calls mein kitna kaam chhupa hai, kabhi socha hai? Ab ek Indian AI Hinglish calls sun ke khud likh deta hai.",
   "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/w/l1.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Pehli baat: Gnani AI ne 28 October ko Prisma v3.0 launch kiya. Ye Indian phone call audio pe train hua hai, aur nau Indian bhashayein aur English, mix karke bhi samajhta hai.",
   "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/w/l2.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Doosri baat: call ka transcript apne aap ban jaata hai. Us se follow-up ki list nikalna asaan hai. Har call dobara sunna nahi padta, system notes bana deta hai.",
   "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/w/l3.wav"
  },
  {
   "text": "Teesri baat: shuru chhote se karo. Ek hafte ki calls ka transcript uthao, aur dekho kaunse sawal baar baar aate hain. Wahi aapka agla system hai. Ye reel save kar lo.",
   "wav": "/tmp/claude-0/w/l4.wav"
  }
 ],
